    "label_names": [],
    "body": "<h2>You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to manually remove SMS consent from a Klaviyo profile. For information on removing SMS consent for multiple profiles, please see our <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/5227452906523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">article on bulk unsubscribing SMS consent</a>. </p>\n<p>Only Owners, Admins, Managers, and Analysts can remove SMS consent in a profile. </p>\n<h2>Remove SMS consent</h2>\n<p>Removing SMS consent from a profile means you will no longer be able to send them text messages. Unless the profile resubscribes to SMS marketing (e.g., via a signup form), they will automatically be skipped for all future SMS. </p>\n<p>To remove consent from a profile:  </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Audience &gt; </strong><strong>Profiles</strong> tab or search by name or phone number.</li>\n<li>Click the recipient who you want to remove SMS consent for.</li>\n<li>On the <em>Details </em>tab, select the menu next to the SMS channel<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28716055761051\" alt=\"Menu to unsubscribe profile from SMS\">\n</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Unsubscribe from SMS.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Unsubscribe from SMS </strong>to confirm you want to remove consent for SMS.<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28716055758619\" alt=\"Modal to confirm that you want to remove SMS consent from a profile\" width=\"561\" height=\"179\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<p>You will see a red indicator next to their phone number to indicate the profile is no longer consented to receive SMS marketing, as shown in the example below.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28716066249755\" alt=\"Unsubscribed from SMS status\"></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">Going forward, you will not be able to text this profile unless they resubscribe to SMS. </p>\n<h2>Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/5227452906523\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to bulk unsubscribe SMS contacts in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6155416998555\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to clean SMS lists</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360037101072\" target=\"_self\">Understand consent in profiles</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
